; kramanusara chain: velocity = d(displacement)/d(time)
; apeksha: kramanusara wrt physics-time, held in a sthira (fixed) reference frame
; avastha: initial-velocity and final-velocity are velocity wearing a state

(kosha velocity
  (vishesa linear-motion-varga)
  (abheda vega)
  (sthita krama sthira-apeksha)
  (yukta kshetrajna direction)
  (kramanusara displacement)
  (phala acceleration-kramanusara)
  (drishthanta purva-avastha uttara-avastha))
